3. INTENT OF THE AUTHOR  (a statement of intent; it does not limit Section 1)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This Software was written, and is published, for the purpose of learning and
researching how the PML language is used inside AVEVA PDMS: PML 1 / PML 2
syntax, objects (.pmlobj), forms (.pmlfrm), macros (.mac) and the DABACON data
model.

The author does NOT endorse, encourage, recommend or support commercial use of
this Software. Anyone - any person or any company - who uses this Software, in
whole or in part, for commercial, production or project-delivery purposes does
so entirely on their own initiative, on their own judgement and at their own
risk. Such use creates no relationship, obligation, warranty or liability
between the user and the author.

